  "zh": "例 3 的 Coupling：Si VIII 的部分能级标记",
  "en": "Example 3 Coupling: partial Si VIII level labels"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "先计算 example3，再按手册选择部分能级运行 Coupling，需另装 https://github.com/compas/coupling。生成 LK3 / JK3 等标记，不自动执行手册中 sed 补全未转换能级的操作，原完整 LSJ 标记备份为 .lsj.lbl_SAVE，当前标记只含所选能级。",
  "en": "Calculate example3, then run Coupling for the levels selected in the manual. Requires separate installation of https://github.com/compas/coupling. Produces LK3 / JK3 labels without the manual's sed repair for untransformed levels; the original complete LSJ labels are saved as .lsj.lbl_SAVE, while the current labels contain only the selected levels."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "约半分钟",
  "en": "about half a minute"
 },
